\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"13\" ><div class=\"item-point no-line panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w663f227744a80-3-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-2\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-2-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-icon panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"14\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-icon so-widget-sow-icon-default-ae9a661b2197\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-icon-container sow-icon\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"sow-icon-fontawesome sow-fas\" data-sow-icon=\"&#xf4b9;\"\n\t\t \n\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\t<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f227744a80-3-3\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f227744a80-3-3-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"15\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>Start Receiving Eligible Medical and Monetary Benefits.<\/h2>\n<p>We'll fight for your medical treatment, lost wages, and compensation.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1521-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1521-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1521-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"6\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1521-3-0-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3><b>What to Expect When Filing a Workers\u2019 Compensation Claim in San Jose<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Filing a workers\u2019 compensation claim can be stressful, especially when you\u2019re dealing with an injury. Our dedicated San Jose attorneys are here to guide you through every step of the process:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Report Your Injury<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Notify your employer as soon as possible about your workplace injury. This is a critical first step in any workers\u2019 compensation claim.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Seek Medical Treatment<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your health comes first. Get medical attention immediately, and let your doctor know the injury is work-related.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>File Your Claim<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: We will help you complete and submit the DWC-1 form to officially file your claim.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Investigation and Approval<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your claim will be reviewed, and we will work tirelessly to gather evidence and build a strong case to maximize your benefits.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Receive Your Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Once approved, you may receive compensation for medical treatment, lost wages, and any permanent disability.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1521-4\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1521-4\" id=\"what-client-says\" data-stretch-type=\"full-width-stretch\" ><div id=\"pgc-1521-4-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1521-4-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"7\" ><div id=\"pl-w66220449e7c69\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w66220449e7c69-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w66220449e7c69-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w66220449e7c69-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">WHAT CLIENTS SAY<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w66220449e7c69-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"client-says-row2 panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-w66220449e7c69-1\" ><div id=\"pgc-w66220449e7c69-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w66220449e7c69-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w66220449e7c69-1-0-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>I would highly recommend anyone to Franco Munoz law firm. No matter how small your injury! I was injured at work! I called around for a workers compensation lawyer and no one would take my case! I called Franco Munoz and they returned my call right away after I explained about my injuries.  They took my case and were able to get me the best doctors for my treatment and later settled the case for 5 times the original offer from the insurance!! I would highly recommend Franco Munoz's office . All the staff were professional throughout my treatment to the close of my case. <\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: right;\"> \u2013 Chacha K<\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w66220449e7c69-1-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w66220449e7c69-1-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"2\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w66220449e7c69-1-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>I want to 100% recommend Franco Munoz as a Worker\u2019s Compensation (WC) lawyer. I was lucky enough to have them as my WC lawyer. I had spoken to several other worker compensation lawyers before meeting with Franco Munoz. Unlike the other lawyers, I found Franco Munoz very easy to talk with right from the start. They understood what had happened to me with my work situation and showed compassion at my plight. What really impressed me was how well Franco Munoz represented me when dealing with the opposing counsel. They did an excellent job in advocating for my needs and I was very happy with the outcome of the case. I cannot say enough positive things about my experience in working with Franco Munoz. I encourage others to contact him for a free consultation.<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: right;\">\u2013 Alex R.<\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w66220449e7c69-1-2\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w66220449e7c69-1-2-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"3\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w66220449e7c69-1-2-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p>Attorney Steve Franco and his team handled my husband's case and I saw how he navigated the process. He was able to get a good monetary settlement in less than a year. We are very satisfied with his work and I recommend him and the other lawyers who also helped us. God bless them with their wisdom!<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: right;\">- Rosa F. <\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1521-5\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1521-5-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1521-5-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"8\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1521-5-0-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3><b>Types of Workers' Compensation Benefits Available in San Jose<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In California, workers\u2019 compensation provides several types of benefits to help injured workers recover:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Medical Treatment<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Coverage for necessary medical care, including doctor visits, surgeries, medications, and physical therapy.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Temporary Disability Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Payments to replace a portion of your lost wages while you\u2019re unable to work due to your injury.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Permanent Disability Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Compensation if your injury results in a lasting impairment or disability that affects your ability to work.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Supplemental Job Displacement Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Vouchers for retraining or skill enhancement if you cannot return to your previous job.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Death Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Payments to the dependents of a worker who dies from a work-related injury or illness.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Common Workplace Injuries We Handle in San Jose<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">San Jose is home to a diverse range of industries, from tech and construction to healthcare and retail. Our experienced attorneys have helped clients with injuries across many fields, including:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Repetitive Strain Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Common among office workers, tech employees, and manual laborers who perform repetitive tasks.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Construction Accidents<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Including falls, equipment malfunctions, and injuries from heavy machinery.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Back and Neck Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Often resulting from heavy lifting, poor ergonomics, or slip-and-fall accidents.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Head and Brain Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: These serious injuries can occur in any workplace and require immediate attention.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Work-Related Illnesses<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Exposure to toxic substances or hazardous conditions can lead to respiratory issues and other long-term health problems.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Schedule Your Free Consultation Today<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we understand that every workers\u2019 compensation case is unique. That\u2019s why we offer a free, no-obligation consultation to discuss your situation and help you understand your legal options. If you\u2019ve been injured on the job, don\u2019t wait\u2014contact our San Jose office today to get started on your path to recovery.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Call us at (650) 622-5702 or fill out the contact form below to schedule your consultation. Let us fight for the benefits you deserve so you can focus on healing.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1521-6\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1521-6\" data-stretch-type=\"full-width-stretch\" ><div id=\"pgc-1521-6-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1521-6-0-0\" class=\"widget_text so-panel widget widget_custom_html panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"9\" ><div class=\"textwidget custom-html-widget\"><iframe data-src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3172.4311891563602!2d-121.89695618759843!3d37.33229927198397!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x808fcca46c3b42ed%3A0x42979b249f8cab6d!2s99%20S%20Almaden%20Blvd%20Ste%20600%2C%20San%20Jose%2C%20CA%2095113%2C%20USA!5e0!3m2!1sen!2s!4v1775645047098!5m2!1sen!2s\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" src=\"about:blank\" class=\"lazyload\" data-load-mode=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Contact Us NowFor A Free Case EvaluationPlease enter a valid email address San Jose Workers&#8217; Compensation Lawyer: Trusted Legal Representation in the Heart of Silicon Valley At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we understand the challenges that injured workers face when navigating the complex workers\u2019 compensation system. Our office in San Jose offers the same commitment [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_genesis_hide_title":false,"_genesis_hide_breadcrumbs":false,"_genesis_hide_singular_image":false,"_genes